@startuml
title Flow 3 - Musician retrieves their part

actor "Musician" as Mus
participant "SAM UI" as UI
participant "SAM Server" as Server

Mus -> UI: searches by title
UI -> Server: GET /api/sheets?q=...
Server --> UI: results
UI --> Mus: results

Mus -> UI: opens sheet detail ->\nInstrumentations tab
UI --> Mus: table: Instrument | Part Label |\nArchive Location | Condition

Mus -> UI: expands row for their instrument
UI --> Mus: attached files listed

Mus -> UI: downloads part PDF
UI -> Server: GET /api/documents/{id}
Server --> UI: file
UI --> Mus: file download
@enduml